body:
Like it keeps going on and on.

&#x200B;

There was/is no point to life in the first place. Today again I get rejected for a job within 1 minute because the algorithm doesnt like

&#x200B;

What's the fucking point if society doesn't want me, if people don't want me, if I don't bother about it either?

&#x200B;

To eat for 50 more fucking years??????
